#: advanced-nocaptcha-recaptcha.php
msgid "Easily add Google reCAPTCHA to WordPress forms. Upgrade to Premium and gain access to additional features, including hCaptcha and CloudFlare Turnstile integration, CAPTCHA one-click form integration with plugins such as WooCommerce, Contact Form 7, and WP Forms, and many other features."
msgstr "Agrega fácilmente Google reCAPTCHA a los formularios de WordPress. Mejora con Premium y accede a características adicionales, como la integración con hCaptcha, CloudFlare Turnstile y la configuración de CAPTCHA con un solo clic en plugins como WooCommerce, Contact Form 7 y WP Forms, entre otras."

